        "en": "The label has conditions, age limits or notes for children; the label sentence is quoted below."
      },
      "quote": "EpiPen or EpiPen Jr may be administered to pediatric patients at a dosage appropriate to body weight [ see Dosage and Administration (2.1) ] .",
